  {
   "id": "casual-sport-series-tennis-329440@1.1",
   "gameId": "casual-sport-series-tennis-329440",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-13T15:02:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, thanks for the huuuge feedback—reaching out to us, making YouTube videos, and discussing the game in Reddit posts. We heard you, and we want to improve our game so it will be even better for you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Most importantly, we fixed the AI problems that many of you mentioned. We also added a visible difficulty selection, so it's clearer for players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We added more animations to make the game feel more realistic—even when you miss your shot! :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From your feedback, we heard that interrupting your shot was unclear, and many of you didn’t even know it was in the game. So, we added it to the tutorial to make it easier to understand.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We added more options for the players to turn on/off visibility of some aspects of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We fixed an achievement bug.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also fixed a few minor bugs that were so rare you probably didn’t even notice them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And we're working on fixing a major bug that is causing the game to crash when playing a tie-breaker in the fifth game. It will be fixed in the upcoming patch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
